OL,3,GNEWSAKew Gardens asks public for #1m
OL,4,Afor Palm House
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Botanic Gardens in Kew has
OL,7,Fstarted a public fundraising appeal to
OL,8,Fsave the historic Palm House and its
OL,9,Ftropical plant collection.
OL,11,FThe Victorian glasshouse, which has
OL,12,Fstood at the heart of the west London
OL,13,Fgardens since the 1840s, is one of the
OL,14,Fworld's most famous glasshouses.
OL,16,FNow showing signs of deterioration, it
OL,17,Fneeds a #66m renovation project.
OL,19,FSo far, about half the funds have been
OL,20,Fsecured from philanthropists, grants
OL,21,Fand individuals. The gardens now hope
OL,22,Fto raise a further #1m from the public.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
